{"id":"z82-05","volume":82,"volumeTitle":"晋纪四","volumeSubtitle":"","index":5,"title":{"t":"元康三年","s":"元康三年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"晋紀四 · 癸丑","s":"晋纪四 · 癸丑"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"夏季六月，弘农下冰雹，积了三尺深。","tokens":[{"t":"夏","s":"夏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"六","s":"六","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"弘","s":"弘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"農","s":"农","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"雨","s":"雨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"雹","s":"雹","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"深","s":"深","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"三","s":"三","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"尺","s":"尺","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"鲜卑宇文莫槐被部下杀死，弟弟宇文普拨继立。","tokens":[{"t":"鮮","s":"鲜","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"卑","s":"卑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宇","s":"宇","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"文","s":"文","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"莫","s":"莫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"槐","s":"槐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"wèi","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"下","s":"下","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"所","s":"所","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"殺","s":"杀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"弟","s":"弟","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"普","s":"普","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"撥","s":"拨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"拓跋绰去世，弟弟的儿子拓跋弗继立。","tokens":[{"t":"拓","s":"拓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"跋","s":"跋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"綽","s":"绰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"卒","s":"卒","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"弟","s":"弟","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"弗","s":"弗","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"元康三年六月，弘农雨雹，深三尺。鲜卑宇文莫槐被部下所杀，弟弟普拨继立。拓跋绰去世，弟弟的儿子拓跋弗继立。冰雹只记地点和深度。两部的继立都用被杀或卒起句，不写争位的过程。","theme":"这一年中原只记一场冰雹。宇文和拓跋各自换了首领：莫槐死于部下，绰死了以后由侄子弗继位。正文不比较两部的强弱，只把人名和继嗣留下，好接后面弗卒、禄官再分国的事。","technique":"三句。冰雹用尺数。宇文用「为其下所杀」说明死因。拓跋用「弟子」说明弗不是绰的儿子。两句继立的句式一样，死因不同。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"雨雹","reading":"yù báo","note":"下冰雹。雨在这里读 yù。「弘农雨雹，深三尺」。"},{"word":"弘农","reading":"hóng nóng","note":"郡名，在洛阳以西。「弘农雨雹」。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"为","reading":"wéi","note":"被。「为其下所杀」。"},{"word":"其","reading":"qí","note":"他的。「其下」「弟子」。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"弟子","note":"这里是弟弟的儿子，不是学生。「弟子弗立」。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"雨","note":"从天上落下。读 yù。「雨雹」。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"被动句","note":"「为……所杀」表示被部下杀死。"}]}}
